37
00:01:21,426 --> 00:01:22,998
The sheriff called the air field.

38
00:01:23,468 --> 00:01:25,697
The base intelligence officer, Major Jesse

39
00:01:25,717 --> 00:01:27,947
Marcel, went out to the ranch, and brought

40
00:01:27,967 --> 00:01:28,911
the material back.

41
00:01:29,481 --> 00:01:30,866
Then came the announcement.

42
00:01:31,206 --> 00:01:33,287
And within a day, the Commanding General

43
00:01:33,307 --> 00:01:35,493
of the Eighth Air Force, Roger Ramey, said

44
00:01:35,513 --> 00:01:37,226
the debris was a weather balloon.

45
00:01:37,796 --> 00:01:39,711
Brazel's own account, in the same

46
00:01:39,731 --> 00:01:41,880
